            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned the applicability of Brunette\u2019s holding on aliens."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bf4dc16b57aea93195b33d79772ed701c6c282e103df677fad450864a9dbc2e7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bf4dc16b57ae-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked whether \u00a71400 requires the defendant to reside where it resides."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bf4dc16b57aea93195b33d79772ed701c6c282e103df677fad450864a9dbc2e7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bf4dc16b57ae-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan sought clarification about the original \u00a71391 as it relates to Fourco."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Dabney",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bf4dc16b57aea93195b33d79772ed701c6c282e103df677fad450864a9dbc2e7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bf4dc16b57ae-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Dabney, counsel for the respondent, argued that \u00a71400(b) provides a distinct venue definition for non\u2011resident defendants, requiring a regular place of business and an act of infringement, not merely the defendant\u2019s domicile."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Jay",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bf4dc16b57aea93195b33d79772ed701c6c282e103df677fad450864a9dbc2e7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bf4dc16b57ae-0001-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Jay, mr. Jay explained that the 2011 amendment expanded the definition of \u201cdomicile\u201d to include individual defendants and other business entities, modifying the Court\u2019s earlier Brunette interpretation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Jay",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bf4dc16b57aea93195b33d79772ed701c6c282e103df677fad450864a9dbc2e7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bf4dc16b57ae-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Jay, mr. Jay also noted that Fourco\u2019s interpretation of the statutes remains good law."
      }
    ],
